      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ACHROMATIC (8) is progressing well with another good run, placing by one length (21.05) in a Grade 5 at Nowra. Top prospect. DUNDEE SPIKE (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at Nowra in a handy 20.97 beating ACHROMATIC. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Capable of going well again. ZIPPING CRUELLA (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was a bit beyond her last time when eighth (30.77) over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5 but is better suited here over less ground. Has a strong winning record at this journey including one wins. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. MR. MOODIE (3) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
